## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's FurnitureEditor|r 1.0.6
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Copies a group of linked furnishings from one house into another. A first build: it reads the links in the house you stand in, keeps a group as a clipboard, and in another house places the same furnishings from your inventory at the same relative positions and links them again. A paste can name the house to travel to first, a cut moves a group instead of copying it, either can be reserved to happen when you next enter a house, on arrival the quickslot wheel temporarily gains Paste and Move entries, and in the housing editor a linked furnishing gets Copy and Cut buttons: copy or cut, go to any house of yours, and the wheel pastes or moves it. Everything the client might refuse is measured first, from /pbfe, and the answers are printed to chat.
## Version: 1.0.6
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsFurnitureEditor_Data

